  "caption": {
    "text": "Part 2 of TERRAFORM STATE: FIELD NOTES. Terraform doesn't remember your infrastructure — a JSON file does, and everything you fear about Terraform is really a fear about that file. These 10 pages cover what state actually stores, how backends lock it, why drift happens, and how to move, import and recover it without destroying prod. Save it before your next `state rm`.",
